 Messages exist in English (`en`) and Korean (`ko`), in
 `src/i18n/messages.js`. The server answers in `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
+
+## Sites
+
+Send `X-Larder-Site: annex` to select a site; omitting the header selects
+`main`. Header names are case insensitive. An unknown site returns HTTP 400
+with code `unknown_site`.
+
+Batch lists, batch lookup and waste, stock on hand, cooking, alerts, stock
+value and stock-takes use only locations belonging to the selected site.
+A batch or stock-take from another site is treated as missing. Receiving an
+order requires locations in the selected site. Items, suppliers, recipes
+and dishes are shared.
